# Vite build output. Rebuilt fresh by deploy.yml on every release; no
# need to track it in git. Developers can produce it locally with
# `npm install && npm run build` whenever a production-mode preview is
# needed; the Vite dev server (`npm run dev`) doesn't need it at all.
#
# Hand-authored artwork (theme thumbnail) lives at
# `resources/public/thumbnail.png` — tracked in git, and copied to
# `resources/assets/thumbnail.png` on every build via vite's
# `publicDir` option (see vite.config.js). Nothing tracked lives
# directly under `resources/assets/` anymore.
/resources/assets/*
/storage/*.key
/storage/pail
/vendor
.env
.env.backup
.env.production
.phpactor.json
.phpunit.result.cache
Homestead.json
Homestead.yaml
npm-debug.log
yarn-error.log
/auth.json
/.fleet
/.idea
/.nova
/.vscode
/.zed

